<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Specific Needs Team. We are committed to ensuring you have the best possible experience when travelling with us.</p>

<h4>What happens next?</h4/>

<p>We have created case regarding your email, with the case number {!Case.CaseNumber}.
If your travel departure time is within 72 hours, we will respond to your email within 24 hours.
If your travel departure time is more than 72 hours away, we will respond to your email within 5 days.</p>
<p>To speak with a member of the Qantas Customer Specific Needs Team, please contact us on 13 13 13 or via your <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us/flight-bookings.html">local office</a>.</p>

